{"id":"000VXW","title":"#teamflatmates","author":"aqjhs","solvedCount":4,"difficulty":4,"rating":"N/A","firstSeen":"2026-11-11T06:38:21+00:00","posted":"Heute, 01:59 Uhr","rules":"Here's a Dutch Flat Mates take on Phistomefel's Team Sum ruleset.\n\n• Normal Sudoku rules apply.\n\n•\nDutch Flat Mates: Every 5 in the grid must have a 1 directly above it or a 9 directly below it. It may have both, but it doesn’t need both.\n\n•\nTeam Sums:\n\n• Divide the digits from 1 to 9 into two teams such that every digit from 1 to 9 is in exactly one of the two teams.\n\n• The finished grid is divided into orthogonally connected areas which contain only digits from the same team and are bounded by digits of the other team and/or the border of the grid.\n\n• A number clue gives the sum of all the digits in such an area. A ? stands for a digit 0-9. A ?? stands for a two digit number without leading zeros.\n\n• Digits may repeat in such an area and the sum clues are in an arbitrary position within the area.\n\n• Each area has at most one clue, but may also have none at all.\n\nOnline in Sudokupad.\n\nSee also:\n\n• cherry chocolate gluten free\n\n• bootleg #159 (bootleg)\n\n• Dutch Flat Mates: Dual Duel\n\n• Rank Up 20.aq - Dutch Flat Mates\n\n• Top Right Boi","solutionCode":"Column 8, top to bottom, with a - for each change of team. (ex. 123-456-789)","tags":["Sudoku"],"links":[{"url":"https://tinyurl.com/4ws6pujj","kind":"short"},{"url":"https://sudokupad.app/5m49zja5vx","kind":"sudokupad"}],"data":"","error":null,"settings":{},"link":"https://sudokupad.app/5m49zja5vx","linkKind":"sudokupad","summary":{"format":"scl","decoded":true,"rows":10,"cols":9,"cages":0,"hasSolution":true,"features":["lines","overlays","underlays"]},"attempts":0,"fetched":"2026-11-11T06:38:21+00:00"}